-- Dump 3 (all QTEs): decompiles every module inside CombatHandle (Dodge, Sword, Axe, Lockpick...)
-- plus the end of CombatHandle (how it sends replies). The result is split into parts small
-- enough to paste into chat. A small panel lets you tap "Copy part N" for each one.
-- Nothing is sent to the server.

